  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c0dc09dbaa30e694681d8e3582c8800f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dia_Doctor_quarantined people dying
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Quarantined people begin to die
  speakingCharacters:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ac0a97e9935a5844bca54735b28090f, type: 2}
    dialogueLines:
    - line: 'The people that are in the quarantine due to the spreading sickness
        are starting to die - it seems like some sort of plague! '
      choices: []
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
    - line: 'However I was not just sitting around - I was able to find a medicine
        that prevents the worst at least and helps with a slow recovery it seems.
        But the ingredients are more than difficult to gather - meaning, they are
        very costly. '
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'Take what you need from the treasury and prepare as much medicine
          as you can. '
        responseToChoice: 'As you say. '
        consequences:
        - type: 0
          amount: -450
        - type: 6
          amount: 25
        - type: 5
          amount: 30
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 3
          amount: 2
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'The resources are need elsewhere - keep the people locked in
          their houses and wait for it to pass. '
        responseToChoice: 'May their death be swift and painless - but from what
          I have seen, it is not. '
        consequences:
        - type: 5
          amount: -35
        - type: 6
          amount: -20
        - type: 1
          amount: -10
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 3
          amount: -5
        - type: 2
          amount: -3
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
    - line: The silver lining seems to be, that the spread was mostly contained due
        to the quarantine - this seems to be over.
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'Good to hear. '
        responseToChoice: 'But at what cost. '
        consequences: []
        dailyChanges: []
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
